    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index has increased 1,237 points on the week to 8,624. SSY’s assessed fronthaul rate rose $9,150/day to $38,150/day, only $850 below the May peak, and the round-voyage rate almost doubled, rising $7,750/day to $17,000/day. Please note: The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index has been modified to replace the previous Hampton Roads/ Rotterdam route with Seven Islands/ Rotterdam.",
